    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Implements the runtime permission evaluation engine absorbed from Claude Code's multi-layer permission system. Introduces 5-tier settings layering (policy > env > user > project > defaults), glob-based permission rule matching on tool+path patterns, and denial tracking with escalation. Builds on the policy kernel (Feature 049) by adding the dynamic runtime loop that evaluates permissions at tool dispatch time.\n",
